  "unretained": [
    {
      "id": "rust-crates",
      "component": "librsvg",
      "detail": "librsvg 2.62.90 is implemented in Rust. Its release tarball carries Cargo.lock (357 package entries) but no vendored crates; the recipe runs cargo update --workspace and Cargo fetches crate sources from crates.io at build time. Config/SharpLibvipsRustProvenance.json pins, by crates.io checksum, the 159 registry crates a simplified resolver identifies for librsvg-c on aarch64-apple-darwin from that Cargo.lock and the recipe's edits, together with the licence texts each .crate carries; that set is an explicit approximation (resolved-approximation), not the historical compile log, and the crates actually incorporated into libvips-cpp remain unverified."
    },
    {
      "id": "rust-toolchain",
      "component": "librsvg",
      "detail": "The recipe installs a rustup 'nightly' toolchain and 'cargo install cargo-c --locked' at build time (posix.sh lines 113-116); neither the Rust compiler revision nor the cargo-c version is pinned, so the exact toolchain that produced the Rust object code is unknown."
    },
    {
      "id": "apple-toolchain",
      "component": "all",
      "detail": "The darwin-arm64v8 build uses the Xcode clang, Apple SDK, Homebrew pkg-config and system frameworks (Quartz for cairo, CoreText for harfbuzz) of the GitHub Actions macOS runner that ran the release workflow; their versions are not recorded in the pinned recipe."
    },
    {
      "id": "libnsgif-upstream-revision",
      "component": "libnsgif",
      "detail": "libnsgif is vendored inside the libvips tarball (libvips/foreign/libnsgif, 'Last updated 22 Jan 2023'); the libvips tree records neither an upstream libnsgif release nor a commit, so no separate libnsgif source archive can be pinned. Its source is the libvips archive above."
    },
    {
      "id": "pull-request-patch-mutability",
      "component": "libultrahdr",
      "detail": "https://patch-diff.githubusercontent.com/raw/google/libultrahdr/pull/383.patch is a mutable rendering; the digest pinned here is the bytes observed on 05/09/2026 and a later drift would be reported as a verification failure rather than resolved automatically."
    },
    {
      "id": "forge-generated-archive-stability",
      "component": "all",
      "detail": "Items marked forge-generated-archive are tarballs GitHub/GitLab generate from a commit on request; the digests pinned here are the bytes observed on 05/09/2026 and are not guaranteed stable by those forges."
    },
    {
      "id": "third-party-notices-from-main",
      "component": "all",
      "detail": "posix.sh line 480 downloads THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md from the sharp-libvips 'main' branch at build time rather than from the build commit; the shipped README.md table was verified identical to the table at the pinned build commit, but the build-time origin itself is not reproducible."
    },
